   "module_16730315758341": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Hey {{ contact.firstname }},</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Whether they are preparing for a marathon or simply trying to get a few more steps in, chances are many of your patients are living an active lifestyle in some way. How can you support them in their journey?&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Sometimes, starting the conversation is all it takes.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">This month is all about cardio! While it's always important to talk about the importance of exercise and cardiovascular health, we want to share a few extra resources that will make it easy for you to start the conversation.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">We hope you find the article helpful and shareable across your network.&nbsp; We've even suggested some products from our<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> <em><span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span></em></span> line that will help support your patients' cardiovascular health.</span></p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
